  "description": "Discover the Escondido 2 – your new companion for commuting, shopping, or simply cruising around town. Designed with practicality, comfort, and clean lines in mind, this e-bike offers a smoother, easier, and more enjoyable ride.\n\nThanks to its low step-through frame, getting on and off is a breeze – even when the extremely sturdy Atran Velo System racks are fully loaded. Whether you're transporting groceries, commuting with a laptop bag, or rolling home after a visit to the beer garden, this bike adapts effortlessly to your lifestyle.\n\nAt the heart of the Escondido 2 is the Bosch Active Line Plus motor, which provides smooth, quiet assistance with just the right amount of torque for city riding and light touring. Combined with a 500 Wh battery, it delivers enough range (up to 110 km) to get you through your day – and then some.\n\nShimano hydraulic disc brakes provide precise braking power in all weather conditions. Simple, intuitive, and reliable – just like the rest of the bike.",
